  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 1.0.0 Beta 1\n\n### Added\n\n* add description to DI extensions readme in [`2a6872e`](https://github.com/alastairlundy/CliRunner/commit/2a6872e44c3da514d69083a553816ad334a07bf4)\n* add Nuget info badges to DI extensions Readme in [`6ae2490`](https://github.com/alastairlundy/CliRunner/commit/6ae2490e4d050bad8b5abe9ea02641aa070a2cc2)\n* add executableFilePath in [`123c8d8`](https://github.com/alastairlundy/CliRunner/commit/123c8d8c96816022c51e87430e17c26da75a5a3d)\n* add localization and clean up process running in [`03aadca`](https://github.com/alastairlundy/CliRunner/commit/03aadcaf85d40316a4acd3d72ab6308ab69532ea)\n* add xml doc comments in [`d00b0ad`](https://github.com/alastairlundy/CliRunner/commit/d00b0adf43bb1823abde1cf6e6613d34e453372a)\n\n### Changed\n* Update Collection Extensions dependency from 6.0.0 RC 1 to 6.0.0\n* Add dependency on System Extensions 6.0.0\n* Update SPECIALIZATIONS_README.md in [`37bd8c7`](https://github.com/alastairlundy/CliRunner/commit/37bd8c7768e55ac9a564941b52aa5cfdee4b0ce4)\n* move file resolver path helpers in [`7f2113f`](https://github.com/alastairlundy/CliRunner/commit/7f2113f42e89a71f466cbcbcd6be133fcfcc4e8e)\n* Update CommandBuilder.cs in [`915235f`](https://github.com/alastairlundy/CliRunner/commit/915235fd8cb23769a3bf22803798dbc8faff59c3)\n* cleanup code in [`e9f99a8`](https://github.com/alastairlundy/CliRunner/commit/e9f99a8ac043e2d2633d4f39f944f6120e4fa866)\n* move extensions to SystemExtensions in [`af6e2c0`](https://github.com/alastairlundy/CliRunner/commit/af6e2c0b036dd41fb9c8a0745be47045dd5d5ed2)\n\n### Removed\n\n* remove redundant SourceLink package reference in [`775188c`](https://github.com/alastairlundy/CliRunner/commit/775188cddff885a4320bca81dd55ab6ddc287ced)\n\n### Fixed\n* rework file path resolving logic in [`37e18ee`](https://github.com/alastairlundy/CliRunner/commit/37e18ee7070f5fe416d56a001dd8844db94b2ef6)\n* fix DI extensions readme issue in [`29aeb8a`](https://github.com/alastairlundy/CliRunner/commit/29aeb8a5e621d7e2ac52e4e312f48c14de257e14)\n* fix build issue in [`7cdff75`](https://github.com/alastairlundy/CliRunner/commit/7cdff75454f19e0430a94dbe97702eefe29b8fad)",
